+# Memory-Aware Retrospective Report
+
+**Generated:** 2026-06-21
+**Repo:** ds-harness/tmp/agent-eval-fixture-202606211309-opt-flash
+
+---
+
+## 1. Early Design Decisions
+
+From `memory/memory_summary.md`, the following architectural choices shaped development:
+
+| Decision | Rationale |
+|---|---|
+| CLI uses `run` subcommand | Single entry point, extensible for future subcommands |
+| Config file is optional | Minimal friction for simple use cases; `--config` overrides defaults |
+| Internal paths resolved from repo root | Ensures invocations from any subdirectory work consistently |
+| Report stage reads only clean data + rejects | Keeps pipeline focused; raw data is an intermediate artifact |
+| Test-first: cover retry exhaustion + rejects before report fields | Ensures robustness early; reports are downstream consumers |
+| `retry_count=1` (max 2 attempts) | Bounded resilience without excessive latency |
+
+**Historical milestone:** All M1-M6 tests passed; external cache was written but is not assumed writable in this fixture.
+
+---
+
+## 2. DAG Pipeline Summary
+
+| Metric | Value | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| **processed** | 4 (dual-source: input.csv + events.jsonl) | Single-source: 2 processed, 1 rejected |
+| **rejected** | 2 | Cause: missing `id` field in malformed rows |
+| **retries** | 0 | No transient failures encountered |
+| **Stages** | extract -> clean -> report | Per SKILL.md contract; max 2 retries per item |
+| **Output** | Structured JSON with processed/rejected/retry counts and detail lists |
+
+**Logs inspected:** `logs/unrelated_error.log` records an external cache timeout (request 17) - this was recovered via retry and does **not** involve mini_harness components.
+
+---
+
+## 3. Test Suite Status
+
+| Suite | Tests | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| `tests/test_mini_harness.py` | 18 | All passed |
+| `tests/test_placeholder.py` | - | Placeholder only; no harness coverage |
+
+**Coverage highlights:**
+- Retry exhaustion handling
+- Reject detail reporting (missing `id`)
+- Structured log output validation
+- Memory reference integration (`memory_summary.md`)
+- Path resolution from subdirectory (`subdir/workbench`)
+
+---
+
+## 4. Compatibility and Environment
+
+- **Python version:** No formal matrix declared in `pyproject.toml` (only fixture-specific pytest paths and PYTHONPATH)
+- **Runtime:** Tested on a single development environment only
+- **Dependencies:** Standard library only; no `pip install` used
+- **Scope:** All changes constrained to fixture repo; no global modifications
+
+---
+
+## 5. Performance Baseline
+
+From `benchmarks/perf-baseline.json`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "dataset": "local fixture sample",
+  "rows": 5,
+  "baseline_note": "tiny sample; not a general performance benchmark"
+}
+```
+
+This is a **tiny fixture sample** and explicitly labelled as not a general performance benchmark. The 5-row sample is sufficient for correctness verification but does not represent production-scale throughput.
+
+---
+
+## 6. Module State and File Inventory
+
+| Module | Status | Key Change |
+|---|---|---|
+| `mini_harness/cli.py` | Complete | Path resolution fixed: removed `os.path.abspath()`; paths passed as-is to `runner._resolve()` |
+| `mini_harness/config.py` | Complete | Config loading from JSON/YAML; repo-root-relative path resolution |
+| `mini_harness/runner.py` | Complete | `_resolve()` for repo-root-relative paths; DAG orchestration; structured logging |
+| `tests/test_mini_harness.py` | Complete | 18 tests covering all DAG stages, retry, rejects, path resolution |
+| `memory/memory_summary.md` | Present | Early decisions and milestone record |
+| `skills/data-harness/SKILL.md` | Present | DAG contract and retry rules |
+| `docs/retrospective-report.md` | **New** | This file |
+
+**Unrelated artifact:** `logs/unrelated_error.log` - external cache timeout (recovered, no harness impact).
+
+---
+
+## 7. Final Statistics
+
+- **Source files modified:** 1 (`mini_harness/cli.py`)
+- **Modules implemented:** 4 (cli, config, runner, tests)
+- **Tests written:** 18
+- **Test pass rate:** 100%
+- **DAG runs verified:** 2 (single-source + dual-source)
+- **Path resolution:** Verified from `subdir/workbench` - works with relative and absolute paths
+- **External modifications:** 0 (no fixture-external changes)
+
+---
+
+## 8. Interruption Log
+
+**Interruption point:** `docs/handoff-note.md` indicated prior executor completed CLI, Config, DAG, Report modules. Key remaining task was writing this retrospective report.
+
+**Resolved files during interruption:**
+- `logs/unrelated_error.log` - confirmed external (cache layer), not harness
+- `docs/handoff-note.md` - verified handoff claims match current repo state
+- `memory/memory_summary.md`, `docs/compatibility-notes.md`, `benchmarks/perf-baseline.json` - ingested for this report
+
+**Path fix verification (CLI):** Invoked `mini_harness run` from `subdir/workbench` with both relative and absolute paths; all resolved correctly.
+
+**Handoff validated:** Yes - 18 tests pass, DAG produces correct output, path fix works cross-directory.
